{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"短期记忆与长期记忆的设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细解释 AI Agent 中短期记忆和长期记忆的定义、区别、各自的作用，以及如何设计一个工程可用的分层记忆系统。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心概念</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LLM 本质上是无状态的——每次调用都像一次\"短暂失忆\"。Memory 系统的本质是为语言模型补上<strong>状态管理能力</strong>，让 Agent 能够记住过去的信息、积累经验、保持上下文连贯。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆的四层分类（基于认知科学）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>感知记忆（Sensory Memory）</strong>：当前输入的原始内容，瞬间处理</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>短期记忆 / 工作记忆（Short-term / Working Memory）</strong>：当前任务上下文，临时存储</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>长期记忆（Long-term Memory）</strong>：持久化存储的知识和经验</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>（可选）程序性记忆（Procedural Memory）</strong>：\"如何做\"的技能和规则</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>短期记忆 vs 长期记忆对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>短期记忆</th>\n<th>长期记忆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>存储位置</td>\n<td>内存/上下文窗口</td>\n<td>外部数据库/向量存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容</td>\n<td>对话历史、中间状态</td>\n<td>用户画像、历史摘要、知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存取速度</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>需要检索，较慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>受限于上下文窗口</td>\n<td>几乎无限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久性</td>\n<td>会话结束即消失</td>\n<td>长期保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>每轮更新</td>\n<td>按需更新/定期批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间特异性</td>\n<td>高（最近信息）</td>\n<td>低（宏观抽象理解）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>长期记忆的细分</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>情景记忆（Episodic Memory）</strong>：记录具体的交互事件和经历\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">例：\"用户上周询问了Python的安装方法\"</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>语义记忆（Semantic Memory）</strong>：存储事实性知识和概念\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">例：\"用户喜欢使用React技术栈\"</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>程序性记忆（Procedural Memory）</strong>：存储技能和操作流程\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">例：\"处理退款请求的标准流程是...\"</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>分层记忆系统设计</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Optional\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> time\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemoryEntry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span>\n    importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 0-1 重要度评分</span>\n    source<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>            <span class=\"token comment\"># 来源标记</span>\n    memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>       <span class=\"token comment\"># episodic / semantic / procedural</span>\n    embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Optional<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HierarchicalMemory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"分层记忆系统\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_context_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">8000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> vector_store\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第一层：工作记忆（当前上下文）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>working_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第二层：短期记忆（最近N轮完整对话）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term_window <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留最近10轮</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第三层：中期记忆（摘要）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mid_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 第四层：长期记忆（向量数据库）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> vector_store\n        \n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_context_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_context_tokens\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_interaction</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记录一次交互\"\"\"</span>\n        entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"User: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\nAgent: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>agent_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            timestamp<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            importance<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_score_importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            source<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"dialogue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            memory_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"episodic\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 写入短期记忆</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 窗口溢出时压缩</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term_window<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            old_entries <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_compress_to_mid_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>old_entries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_score_importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"评估交互重要度\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"评估以下对话的重要度(0-1):\\n用户: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n助手: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>agent_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n重要度:\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">min</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>score<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_compress_to_mid_term</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> entries<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将多条短期记忆压缩为中期摘要\"\"\"</span>\n        content <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> e <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> entries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"将以下对话总结为简洁的摘要(保留关键信息):\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n摘要:\"</span></span>\n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        summary_entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            timestamp<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entries<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            importance<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> e <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> entries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            source<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"summary\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            memory_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"episodic\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mid_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>summary_entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve_relevant</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检索相关记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 从短期记忆中取最近N条</span>\n        results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> e <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 从向量数据库检索相关长期记忆</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            long_term_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>similarity_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>long_term_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> results\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">persist_to_long_term</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将中期记忆持久化到长期存储\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> entry <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mid_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding <span class=\"token keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_get_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                metadata<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"importance\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory_type\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mid_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_get_embedding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> text<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取文本的 embedding\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用 embedding API</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"为当前 LLM 调用构建上下文\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 组装：系统指令 + 相关长期记忆 + 中期摘要 + 短期记忆</span>\n        relevant <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrieve_relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        context_parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            context_parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"相关背景:\\n\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        context_parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> e <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context_parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：为什么不直接把历史对话全塞进上下文窗口？答：受限于上下文窗口长度、无关信息会稀释注意力（上下文腐烂）、token 成本高昂。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：工作记忆和短期记忆的区别？答：工作记忆是当前活跃的任务状态（变量、参数），短期记忆是最近N轮对话历史。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：记忆系统怎么保证一致性？答：写入时去重、更新时带时间戳、冲突时新信息优先。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：认为上下文窗口越大越好。实际上过长上下文会导致性能退化（上下文腐烂）。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：所有信息都存长期记忆。实际上应该分级，频繁访问的信息放在更快层。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：记忆写入不需要筛选。什么都存会导致检索噪声增加、存储膨胀。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}